  "detail_text": "The Anniston Army Depot (ANAD) Military Construction (MILCON) project to design and construct buildings is to build four (4) buildings with different purposes at ANAD. The four (4) buildings resulting from this Other Transaction Authority are a Component Remanufacture Facility, a Missile Maintenance Facility, a Paint Facility, and a Storage Facility. This agreement operates under Title 10, United States Code (U.S.C.), section 2808a (Facility construction on repair: transactions other than contracts and grants) that are directly relevant to enhancing the ability of the Department of War to carry out repair and construction projects for facilities, including the planning, design, engineering, prototyping, piloting, and execution of such repair and construction projects. An on-site visit is tentatively planned for May 14, 2026. Details will be published next week. Please use the spreadsheet titled \"QA_ANAD_FORGE II\" to submit questions no later than May 6, 2026 by 4:00 CT.",
